WEBVTT

00:00:00.793 --> 00:00:01.540
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.444 --> 00:00:04.166
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I can see the sea from here.

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:06.723
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:07.615 --> 00:00:09.591
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I write with my right hand.

00:00:11.593 --> 00:00:12.412
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:13.317 --> 00:00:14.983
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> He won one game.

00:00:16.801 --> 00:00:17.660
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:18.465 --> 00:00:20.453
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I know there’s no hope.